{"title":"AI Engineer Roadmap","role":"AI Engineer","summary":"An AI Engineer designs, develops, evaluates, integrates, deploys, and maintains AI-powered software systems.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E.","Course":"CSE - Artificial Intelligence & Data Science (AI&DS)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An AI Engineer designs, develops, evaluates, integrates, deploys, and maintains AI-powered software systems."},{"type":"p","text":"The role combines:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Computer science"},{"text":"Programming"},{"text":"Mathematics"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Machine learning"},{"text":"Deep learning"},{"text":"Data engineering"},{"text":"Software engineering"},{"text":"Cloud computing"},{"text":"MLOps"},{"text":"Generative AI"}]},{"type":"p","text":"AI Engineers can work on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Machine learning systems"},{"text":"Recommendation engines"},{"text":"Computer vision"},{"text":"Natural language processing"},{"text":"Speech AI"},{"text":"Generative AI"},{"text":"LLM applications"},{"text":"AI agents"},{"text":"Predictive analytics"},{"text":"Fraud detection"},{"text":"Autonomous systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong modern profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Software Engineering","Machine Learning","Data","MLOps","Generative AI"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An AI Engineer can specialize in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Machine Learning Engineering"},{"text":"Deep Learning"},{"text":"Generative AI"},{"text":"LLM Engineering"},{"text":"NLP"},{"text":"Computer Vision"},{"text":"Speech AI"},{"text":"Recommendation Systems"},{"text":"Time-Series AI"},{"text":"AI Infrastructure"},{"text":"MLOps"},{"text":"AI Platform Engineering"},{"text":"Applied AI"},{"text":"Edge AI"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Long-term positions include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI Engineer"},{"text":"Machine Learning Engineer"},{"text":"Applied AI Engineer"},{"text":"ML Platform Engineer"},{"text":"Senior AI Engineer"},{"text":"AI Architect"},{"text":"Staff ML Engineer"},{"text":"AI Engineering Manager"},{"text":"Principal AI Engineer"},{"text":"Head of AI Engineering"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 1 — Programming & Mathematical Foundations","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The first year should focus heavily on programming and mathematics."},{"type":"h","text":"Programming"},{"type":"p","text":"Make Python the primary language."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Variables"},{"text":"Data types"},{"text":"Functions"},{"text":"Loops"},{"text":"Conditions"},{"text":"Lists"},{"text":"Dictionaries"},{"text":"Sets"},{"text":"Tuples"},{"text":"File handling"},{"text":"Exceptions"},{"text":"Object-oriented programming"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Also gain basic exposure to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"C/C++"},{"text":"Java"},{"text":"These are useful for broader computer-science fundamentals."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Mathematics"},{"type":"p","text":"AI requires significantly more mathematical maturity than simply knowing ML libraries."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Linear Algebra"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Vectors"},{"text":"Matrices"},{"text":"Matrix multiplication"},{"text":"Eigenvalues"},{"text":"Eigenvectors"},{"text":"Transformations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Calculus"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Derivatives"},{"text":"Partial derivatives"},{"text":"Gradients"},{"text":"Chain rule"},{"text":"Optimization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Probability"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Random variables"},{"text":"Probability distributions"},{"text":"Conditional probability"},{"text":"Bayes theorem"},{"text":"Expectation"},{"text":"Variance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Statistics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mean"},{"text":"Variance"},{"text":"Correlation"},{"text":"Hypothesis testing"},{