y be able to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Write production-quality Python"},{"text":"Solve algorithmic problems"},{"text":"Understand probability and statistics"},{"text":"Build ML models"},{"text":"Perform proper model evaluation"},{"text":"Implement deep-learning models"},{"text":"Use PyTorch"},{"text":"Build NLP or computer-vision applications"},{"text":"Understand Transformer architecture"},{"text":"Build RAG applications"},{"text":"Integrate LLM APIs"},{"text":"Develop tool-using AI applications"},{"text":"Build REST APIs"},{"text":"Work with SQL databases"},{"text":"Use Git professionally"},{"text":"Containerize AI applications"},{"text":"Deploy models/services to cloud"},{"text":"Understand basic MLOps"},{"text":"Monitor model performance"},{"text":"Evaluate AI system quality"},{"text":"Identify security and privacy risks"},{"text":"Build 2–3 substantial end-to-end AI projects"}]}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Tech/B.E. CSE - Artificial Intelligence & Data Science student targeting AI Engineer, the strongest positioning is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Computer Science","Software Engineering","Machine Learning","Generative AI","MLOps"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The biggest mistake would be treating AI engineering as simply \"knowing Python and using an LLM API.\" A professional AI Engineer needs to understand the complete lifecycle:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Problem","Data","Model","Evaluation","Application","Deployment","Monitoring","Iteration"]},{"type":"h","text":"Priority Skill Order"},{"type":"p","text":"1. Python + Programming\n2. Data Structures & Algorithms\n3. Mathematics + Statistics\n4. SQL + Data Engineering Fundamentals\n5. Machine Learning\n6. Deep Learning + PyTorch\n7. Software Engineering + APIs\n8. Generative AI + LLMs + RAG\n9. MLOps + Cloud + Deployment\n10. AI Evaluation, Security & Responsible AI"},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest graduate profile is an AI Engineer who can build an AI model, integrate it into a real software product, deploy it to production, evaluate its behavior, and maintain it reliably at scale."}]}]}